0"},"children":"Regulatory Response"}],["$","span","2",{"children":": Potential rules governing AI use in hiring processes, both for candidates and employers"}]]}],["$","h3","258",{"style":{"fontSize":"22px","fontWeight":"600","margin":"32px 0 16px","color":"#f5f5f5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The Long View"}]]}],["$","p","260",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The interview coaching phenomenon is an early signal of how AI will transform professional development. Just as calculators changed mathematics education and spell-checkers changed writing, AI coaching tools will become standard equipment for career advancement."}]]}],["$","p","262",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The question is not whether AI will be used in interview preparation, but how society will adapt to ensure fair evaluation and authentic assessment of human capability."}]]}],["$","hr","264",{"style":{"border":"none","borderTop":"1px solid #1a1a1a","margin":"32px 0"}}],["$","h2","266",{"style":{"fontSize":"28px","fontWeight":"600","margin":"40px 0 20px","color":"#f5f5f5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"How to Try AI Interview Coaching"}]]}],["$","p","268",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"For readers interested in experimenting with AI interview coaching, here's a starter workflow:"}]]}],["$","p","270",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Step 1: Company Research"}]]}],["$","p","271",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Prompt: \"Analyze [Company Name]'s recent quarterly earnings and strategic priorities. What are their biggest challenges? What qualities would they value in a [Role Name]?\""}]]}],["$","p","273",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Step 2: Question Generation"}]]}],["$","p","274",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Prompt: \"I'm interviewing for a [Role] position at [Company]. Generate 10 behavioral interview questions specific to their culture and recent business developments.\""}]]}],["$","p","276",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Step 3: Answer Practice"}]]}],["$","p","277",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Prompt: \"I'll answer a behavioral question. Give me feedback on structure, content, and delivery. Suggest specific improvements. [Your Answer]\""}]]}],["$","p","279",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Step 4: Mock Interview"}]]}],["$","p","280",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Prompt (voice mode recommended): \"Conduct a 20-minute behavioral interview for [Role] at [Company]. Ask questions, wait for my answers, then provide feedback.\""}]]}],["$","hr","282",{"style":{"border":"none","borderTop":"1px solid #1a1a1a","margin":"32px 0"}}],["$","h2","284",{"style":{"fontSize":"28px","fontWeight":"600","margin":"40px 0 20px","color":"#f5f5f5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Conclusion"}]]}],["$","p","286",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The AI interview coaching boom in China reveals something profound about the current moment: AI is becoming infrastructure for everyday life, not just a novelty or productivity tool. When millions of young people facing existential career pressure turn to AI for help, the technology has crossed from \"interesting\" to \"essential.\""}]]}],["$","p","288",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The platforms that win in this space—Kimi, Doubao, Tongyi Qianwen—are those that understand the emotional stakes involved. Interview preparation is not a casual chat; it's high-stakes performance coaching with real consequences."}]]}],["$","p","290",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"For the global AI community, China's experience offers a preview of how users will repurpose general-purpose tools for specific needs. The interview coaching use case will replicate across cultures and contexts, with local adaptations."}]]}],["$","p","292",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"The deeper question is what this means for human evaluation itself. As AI makes everyone better at interviews, how will we distinguish genuine capability from polished performance? The arms race between AI-assisted candidates and AI-assisted recruiters has only just begun."}]]}],["$","hr","294",{"style":{"border":"none","borderTop":"1px solid #1a1a1a","margin":"32px 0"}}],["$","h2","296",{"style":{"fontSize":"28px","fontWeight":"600","margin":"40px 0 20px","color":"#f5f5f5"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"What Chinese Users Are Saying"}]]}],["$","p","298",{"style":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"1.8","margin":"16px 0","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","s