ht in interviews. Too formulaic.\"*"}]]}]]}],["$","blockquote","315",{"style":{"borderLeft":"4px solid #22d3ee","paddingLeft":"24px","margin":"24px 0","fontStyle":"italic","color":"#a3a3a3"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"豆瓣 @待业青年"}]]}],["$","p","1",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"\"没钱报班，Kimi就是我的免费面试教练，感恩科技。\""}]]}],["$","p","2",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"*\"Can't afford coaching classes. Kimi is my free interview coach. Grateful for technology.\"*"}]]}]]}],["$","blockquote","319",{"style":{"borderLeft":"4px solid #22d3ee","paddingLeft":"24px","margin":"24px 0","fontStyle":"italic","color":"#a3a3a3"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"GitHub @code-for-offer"}]]}],["$","p","1",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"\"Prompt工程做好了，AI面试准备效果不输真人教练。\""}]]}],["$","p","2",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"*\"With good prompt engineering, AI interview prep is no worse than human coaching.\"*"}]]}]]}],["$","blockquote","323",{"style":{"borderLeft":"4px solid #22d3ee","paddingLeft":"24px","margin":"24px 0","fontStyle":"italic","color":"#a3a3a3"},"children":[["$","p","0",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Twitter/X @ChinaTechWatch"}]]}],["$","p","1",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"\"中国AI面试辅导现象值得西方关注 - 这是AI真正解决实际问题的案例。\""}]]}],["$","p","2",{"style":{"margin":"8px 0"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"*\"China's AI interview coaching phenomenon deserves Western attention—this is AI solving real problems.\"*"}]]}]]}],["$","hr","324",{"style":{"border":"none","borderTop":"1px solid #1a1a1a","margin":